{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter the Deathground, a terrifying survival horror experience where you\u2019re hunted by reactive, relentless dinosaurs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play solo or team up with up to 3 others as you infiltrate abandoned facilities, now overrun and crawling with danger, to complete high-risk objectives. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scary and Blood-Thirsty Dinosaurs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against relentless predators that hunt using sight, sound and movement, forcing you to adapt your strategy in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/AI.gif?t=1750245300\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Thrilling Gameplay, Built for Replayability</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each mission in Deathground is a tense encounter where every decision matters. Procedurally generated elements, dynamic objectives and reactive enemy AI create a fresh, high-stakes challenge with every playthrough. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use stealth, combat, teamwork and a range of specialist tools to adapt, outsmart your predators and make it to extraction. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/Intensegameplay.gif?t=1750245300\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Squad-based survival horror</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coordinate with up to 3 other players and manage specialist items such as the Motion Detector, Tranquilizer Rifle, Hacking Device or Medkit, each offering unique tactical advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With deadly threats lurking in every shadow, teamwork and cooperation can mean the difference between extraction and extinction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/Squadplay.gif?t=1750245300\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solo Play</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leave your teammates behind in favour of a solo session, if you dare. Enter at your own risk, the horror only intensifies as you attempt to escape and survive alone.  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/Soloplay.gif?t=1750245300\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Truly terrifying, Anxious and Diverse Environments</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a range of abandoned, decaying research facilities, each with its own unique theme, challenges and hazards. These environments are designed to build tension and challenge your survival instincts at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/Environments.gif?t=1750245300\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Original Soundtrack</strong><br>A haunting music score by BAFTA-nominated composer, David Housden (Thomas was Alone, Volume, Q.U.B.E. 2). </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1200770?t=1750245300","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750245300","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750245300","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750245300","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content which is not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content.\r\n\r\nThere are no depictions of sexual acts or drug and alcohol abuse."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>MAKE SURE TO WISHLIST DEATHGROUND!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/Steam-Store-Wishlist_600x250px_GIF.gif?t=1750245300\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Add Deathground to your wishlist!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The best thing you can do to support us is wishlist the game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help boost the game's visibility on Steam with just a click, it'll also ensure that you get notified as soon as we release. We appreciate your support!</p></p><br><h1>GET EARLY DEVELOPMENT UPDATES ON DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/DiscordSteam.jpg?t=1750245300\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Join our Discord Server</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get regular sneak peeks and behind-the-scenes of Deathground's development, chat with our community and feedback on the game. You never know, you might find your future squad mates there.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter the Deathground, a terrifying survival horror experience where you\u2019re hunted by reactive, relentless dinosaurs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play solo or team up with up to 3 others as you infiltrate abandoned facilities, now overrun and crawling with danger, to complete high-risk objectives. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scary and Blood-Thirsty Dinosaurs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against relentless predators that hunt using sight, sound and movement, forcing you to adapt your strategy in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/AI.gif?t=1750245300\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Thrilling Gameplay, Built for Replayability</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each mission in Deathground is a tense encounter where every decision matters. Procedurally generated elements, dynamic objectives and reactive enemy AI create a fresh, high-stakes challenge with every playthrough. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use stealth, combat, teamwork and a range of specialist tools to adapt, outsmart your predators and make it to extraction. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/Intensegameplay.gif?t=1750245300\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Squad-based survival horror</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coordinate with up to 3 other players and manage specialist items such as the Motion Detector, Tranquilizer Rifle, Hacking Device or Medkit, each offering unique tactical advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With deadly threats lurking in every shadow, teamwork and cooperation can mean the difference between extraction and extinction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/Squadplay.gif?t=1750245300\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solo Play</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leave your teammates behind in favour of a solo session, if you dare. Enter at your own risk, the horror only intensifies as you attempt to escape and survive alone.  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/Soloplay.gif?t=1750245300\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Truly terrifying, Anxious and Diverse Environments</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a range of abandoned, decaying research facilities, each with its own unique theme, challenges and hazards. These environments are designed to build tension and challenge your survival instincts at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/Environments.gif?t=1750245300\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Original Soundtrack</strong><br>A haunting music score by BAFTA-nominated composer, David Housden (Thomas was Alone, Volume, Q.U.B.E. 2). </p>","developers":["Jaw Drop Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/header.jpg?t=1750245300","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 Jaw Drop Games 2025. All Rights Reserved. <br />\r\nDeathground and Jaw Drop Games logos are trademarks or registered trademarks of Jaw Drop Games Ltd.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257117194,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117194/movie480.mp4?t=1742558739","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117194/mo